OL,3,AAt least one dead and four injured in
OL,4,AParis suburb shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and four
OL,7,Fothers injured in a Parisian suburb,
OL,8,FFrench Prime Minister Sebastien Lecornu
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe "very serious events" happened in
OL,12,FTrappes, to the west of Paris, Lecornu
OL,13,Fwrote on social media, adding that the
OL,14,Fsuspected attack had been "apprehended
OL,15,Fand placed in police custody".
OL,17,FA police source said a man opened fire
OL,18,Ffrom a vehicle on Friday, according to
OL,19,Fnews agency AFP, and was later arrested
OL,20,Fin the nearby town of Coignieres at
OL,21,Fabout 10:30 local time (08:30 GMT).
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
