OL,3,AAt least one dead and four injured in
OL,4,AParis suburb shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports in French media suggest the
OL,7,Fnumber of injured may be higher and
OL,8,Fthat a 12-year-old child may be among
OL,9,Fthem.
